===Resources===
[[File:Dom Onion's Reward Shop stock.png|thumb|300px|The rewards for participating in the Nightmare Zone.]]
Resources include certain [[Herblore]] ingredients, elemental [[runes]], and items that are only obtainable via the minigame, such as [[herb box]]es and [[scroll of redirection|scrolls of redirection]]. Players can only buy up to 15 herb boxes per day.

[[Ironman mode|Ironmen]] can only buy scrolls of redirection from this tab.

